This product is a graphical front-end for colibri
(https://github.com/JustVugg/colibri, Apache License 2.0). It does not
contain colibri source code or binaries; it runs a separate colibri checkout
that the user installs, and talks to it through its documented `coli` JSON
commands and its OpenAI-compatible HTTP API.

Language models are downloaded by colibri from their publishers (for example
on Hugging Face) and are covered by their own licences, shown by this
application before any download.

Third-party Rust crates and fonts are listed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

Embedded fonts: Inter and JetBrains Mono (SIL Open Font License 1.1, see licenses/).
